Source: pg-net
Section: database
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Ruohang Feng <rh@vonng.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), postgresql-all (>= 217~), libcurl4-openssl-dev, libicu-dev
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no
Homepage: https://github.com/supabase/pg_net

Package: postgresql-PGVERSION-pg-net
Architecture: any
Provides: postgresql-pg-net
Depends: ${postgresql:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Asynchronous HTTP requests from PostgreSQL PGVERSION
 pg_net lets PostgreSQL issue asynchronous HTTP and HTTPS requests from SQL.
 This compatibility package keeps Ubuntu 22.04 on upstream 0.9.2 because its
 libcurl 7.81 predates the API required by newer pg_net releases.
